  <text>
    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="3.2">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IIIAtr">III Atr</ref> 3.2</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">⁊ niman þonne þa tihtbysian men þe mid þam gerefan [sace] habbað, ⁊ heora ælc sylle VI healfmarc wedd, healf landrícan ⁊ healf wǽpentake.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">And then they shall arrest those men of ill repute against whom the reeve is taking proceedings, and each of them shall pay six half marks as security, half to the lord of the manor, and half to the wapentake.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Et capiantur accusati, qui cum preposito causam habent, et omnis eorum det VI dimidias marcas uadii, dimidium domino ipsius terre, diminium wapentako.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
